978473676440062_614780440358552300_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E6QbQWu24DIQ7kNvwHewJv0&_nc_oc=AdrhxrRyzCJoB0U7NMICUaY2Aug1gdUbCarnXQO4I_ivBgBRmMztU7_bjlSwxsfyR_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGBWmqqT2EdZLNgKbFgIcBgs0zjsnOyaPk4EfqeG4prg&oe=6AE9FD04"}, {"file_name": "label_maker.png", "id": "510691753810226", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001687_510691757143559_4272398475938808392_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wkt09u9qEqkQ7kNvwH1HqxZ&_nc_oc=Adp31nip7X3v3JnhmzUP6KVZAuUw6KXdOcA2__iPHjM6axQmreYoYTGNA2mmunLSboM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSiR17-0paTkUST9Uhj_tsS_-s1L03PbfB8tklPRpjcgw&oe=6AE9DFF8"}, {"file_name": "dark.png", "id": "294485389441819", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_294485392775152_3398830198699120944_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z1xeW4bAnnAQ7kNvwE7ip83&_nc_oc=AdpjNDkIE8q-oMQevRKekG4OggV-qiGGi_rCw0RVvfLeY2wxNNLJ_uRVgtVKRj2odok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQQXYbxBDYa6torgbRz8WxWfQgLdWLOhcKSN5hMwWe8g&oe=6AEA086A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cockpit_processing.png", "id": "513516810110514", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_513516813443847_8652589313076468317_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SRrqqNzuQzcQ7kNvwGueqe-&_nc_oc=AdrVHr7afz-i2-96dgX6AE4vQI2TRJyvR8wZQZODDCp0J77zdPVOQYZkIpvqNVCPyHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTmYcmc5Rq3TgM3wxT92G80jQ2ZFGxUQAmE_J2gMgkxjw&oe=6AE9DFB9"}, "display_name": "I Fetch Rocks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The year is 2150. You\u2019ve successfully landed a job working for one of the many mining facilities stationed in the asteroid belt between Jupiter and Mars. Using a company issued Asteroid Hauler, your job is to search for mineral rich asteroids and tow them back to the primary mining facility for further processing.\n\nBe warned, this trivial sounding job will push you to your creative engineering limits. The asteroid belt is extremely dangerous, radiation and cosmic rays will continuously degrade the components of your ship. Over the course of your employment you will need to become intimately familiar with how all ship systems operate and fit together so that you can rearrange, rewire and reprogram them as they fail around you. You\u2019ll need to get creative to survive and get your payload back to the primary mining facility.\n\nAll components can be connected using red cables which simulate power distribution and green cables which simulate data flow from user input and various sensors.", "short_description": "Co-Operative Multi-player and Single-player Asteroid Hauler simulator designed from the ground up for Room Scale Virtual Reality. Completely customize, maintain and repair the controls and systems of your ship using 100s of interconnecting components that fully simulate power and data distribution. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sarumxr.com/i_fetch_rocks_privacy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SarumXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sarumxr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "SPACE_UNIVERSE", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "7488302667945177"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1762732141729930"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2118934902395176"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2209065186118586"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "927665445726151"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "927665445726151"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1762732141729930"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28482980964717375", "version": "1.3.1.3"}, "id": "1364350543986050", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4687614158014056", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28482980964717375"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1364350543986050"}]}, "change_log": "Multiplayer reliability fixes for asteroid synchronization and recovery, door operability, late-join ownership, and out-of-order movement updates.", "created_date": 1792583669, "id": "28482980964717375", "version": "1.3.1.3", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4687614158014056", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28482980964717375"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1364350543986050"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed an issue where selecting a saved game after death did not show the Resume button, requiring a restart.", "created_date": 1792484496, "id": "28467519456263526", "version": "1.3.1.2", "version_code": 117, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4687614158014056", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28482980964717375"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1364350543986050"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes for 1.3.1.1\n\nMultiplayer games now only end when all players are unconscious\nAdded the ability for players to revive unconscious team mates\nImproved multiplayer recovery with brief network interruptions\n- Hosts now keep their current game when their connections drop\n- game automatically resyncs when connections recover\nAdded better multiplayer reconnecting notifications\n", "created_date": 1792177757, "id": "28420948797587259", "version": "1.3.1.1", "version_code": 116, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4687614158014056", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28482980964717375"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1364350543986050"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed oxygen sometimes failing to circulate between rooms at equal pressure.", "created_date": 1791095841, "id": "28246658841682923", "version": "1.3.0.1", "version_code": 112, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4687614158014056", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28482980964717375"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1364350543986050"}]}, "change_log": "Space gets more dangerous.\n\nThis update features a new optional game mode called Hard Vacuum. This turns each room into an environment that must be actively managed as power hungry equipment now produces heat that you'll need to control using the new heat exchangers and micrometeorites can punch through your hull where you'll need to manage pressure loss on a room by room basis. This of course means you can now die from pressure loss, hypothermia and hyperthermia.\n\nHard Vacuum\n\nEvery compartment now tracks temperature, pressure, oxygen, nitrogen, carbon dioxide and carbon monoxide.\n\nEvery door has doorway vents that can be controlled on either side, this allows you to isolate a compartment so that you can maintain pressure where you need it or to slow down heat transfer between rooms. A dangerous pressure differential will stop the door from working, but there might be a way to override that. \n\nPowered modules generate heat in the containing room.\n\nHeat is gradually lost through the hull into space, but you'll need to use the heat exchangers to remove heat generated by power hungry modules.\n\nHowever, if you leave a heat exchanger running, you could end up cooling your ship down to dangerous levels, so make use of the new temperature sensor module which outputs the room temperature in Celsius, Fahrenheit or Kelvin to control it.\n\nMicrometeorites\n\nWith the Hard Vacuum mode enabled, once you travel beyond the station's safe zone, like radiation, micrometeorites can hit your ship, the farther out you travel the greater the risk. An impact will punch a visible hole through the hull and destroy any module in its immediate path, the hole will start venting the rooms atmosphere into space, so listen carefully for the leak location and place any module over the hole to help stop the leak.\n\nThese holes can be permanently fixed when you dock.\n\nGeneral Fixes\n\nThis update also includes more multiplayer stability fixes and performance improvements.", "created_date": 1790591576, "id": "28174391752242966", "version": "1.3.0.0", "version_code": 111, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}